msgstr "Calculer la prochaine échéance"

#. module: bf_recurrence
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_recurrence.selection__project_task__repeat_anchor__completion
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_recurrence.selection__project_task_recurrence__repeat_anchor__completion
