msgstr "Depuis la date de fermeture"

#. module: bf_recurrence
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_recurrence.selection__project_task__repeat_anchor__deadline
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:bf_recurrence.selection__project_task_recurrence__repeat_anchor__deadline
msgid "From the deadline"
msgstr "Depuis l'échéance"

#. module: bf_recurrence
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_recurrence.field_project_task__repeat_anchor
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_recurrence.field_project_task_recurrence__repeat_anchor
msgid ""
"From the deadline: the next deadline is the previous one pushed by the interval, whenever the task was closed.\n"
"From the closing date: the next deadline starts from when the task was closed. Closing early brings the next occurrence closer; closing late pushes it back as much, with no catch-up."
msgstr ""
"Depuis l'échéance : la prochaine échéance est l'ancienne reportée de l'intervalle, peu importe le moment de la fermeture.\n"
"Depuis la date de fermeture : la prochaine échéance part du moment où la tâche a été fermée. Fermer en avance rapproche l'occurrence suivante ; fermer en retard la repousse d'autant, sans rattrapage."

